 "de": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Wir verwenden Cookies, damit dieser Shop funktioniert – zum Beispiel, um Artikel im Warenkorb zu behalten und Einstellungen zu speichern. Mit Einwilligung verwenden wir Cookies auch für Personalisierung, Analyse und Marketing.</p>\n<p>Die Einwilligung kann jederzeit geändert oder widerrufen werden.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookie-Einstellungen</a></p>\n<p>Mehr dazu in unserer <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "fr": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Nous utilisons des cookies pour faire fonctionner cette boutique, par exemple pour conserver les articles de votre panier et mémoriser vos préférences. Avec votre consentement, nous utilisons également des cookies pour la personnalisation, l’analyse et le marketing.</p>\n<p>Vous pouvez modifier ou retirer votre consentement à tout moment.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Paramètres des cookies</a></p>\n<p>En savoir plus dans notre <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Politique de confidentialité</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "es": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Usamos cookies para que esta tienda funcione, por ejemplo, para mantener los artículos en tu carrito y recordar tu configuración. Con tu consentimiento, también usamos cookies para personalización, análisis y marketing.</p>\n<p>Puedes cambiar o retirar tu consentimiento en cualquier momento.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Configuración de cookies</a></p>\n<p>Más información en nuestra <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Política de privacidad</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "it": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Utilizziamo i cookie per far funzionare questo negozio, ad esempio per mantenere gli articoli nel tuo carrello e ricordare le tue impostazioni. Con il tuo consenso, utilizziamo i cookie anche per personalizzazione, analisi e marketing.</p>\n<p>Puoi modificare o revocare il tuo consenso in qualsiasi momento.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Impostazioni cookie</a></p>\n<p>Maggiori informazioni nella nostra <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Informativa sulla privacy</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "nl": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>We gebruiken cookies om deze winkel te laten werken, bijvoorbeeld om artikelen in je winkelwagen te bewaren en je instellingen te onthouden. Met je toestemming gebruiken we cookies ook voor personalisatie, analyse en marketing.</p>\n<p>Je kunt je toestemming op elk moment wijzigen of intrekken.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookie-instellingen</a></p>\n<p>Lees meer in ons <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">privacybeleid</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "pl": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Używamy plików cookie, aby ten sklep działał, na przykład aby zachować produkty w Twoim koszyku i zapamiętać Twoje ustawienia. Za Twoją zgodą używamy plików cookie również do personalizacji, analityki i marketingu.</p>\n<p>W każdej chwili możesz zmienić lub wycofać swoją zgodę.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Ustawienia plików cookie</a></p>\n<p>Więcej informacji znajdziesz w naszej <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Polityce prywatności</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "pt-PT": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Utilizamos cookies para que esta loja funcione, por exemplo, para manter os artigos no teu carrinho e memorizar as tuas definições. Com o teu consentimento, utilizamos também cookies para personalização, análise e marketing.</p>\n<p>Podes alterar ou retirar o teu consentimento a qualquer momento.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Definições de cookies</a></p>\n<p>Sabe mais na nossa <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Política de Privacidade</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "sv": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Vi använder cookies för att den här butiken ska fungera, till exempel för att spara varor i din varukorg och komma ihåg dina inställningar. Med ditt samtycke använder vi även cookies för personalisering, analys och marknadsföring.</p>\n<p>Du kan när som helst ändra eller återkalla ditt samtycke.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookie-inställningar</a></p>\n<p>Läs mer i vår <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">integritetspolicy</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "da": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Vi bruger cookies for at få denne butik til at fungere, for eksempel til at gemme varer i din kurv og huske dine indstillinger. Med dit samtykke bruger vi også cookies til personalisering, analyse og markedsføring.</p>\n<p>Du kan til enhver tid ændre eller trække dit samtykke tilbage.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookieindstillinger</a></p>\n<p>Læs mere i vores <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">privatlivspolitik</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "nb": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Vi bruker informasjonskapsler for at denne butikken skal fungere, for eksempel for å beholde varer i handlekurven din og huske innstillingene dine. Med ditt samtykke bruker vi også informasjonskapsler til personalisering, analyse og markedsføring.</p>\n<p>Du kan når som helst endre eller trekke tilbake samtykket ditt.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Innstillinger for informasjonskapsler</a></p>\n<p>Les mer i vår <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">personvernerklæring</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "ja": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>当ストアでは、カートに商品を保持したり設定を記憶したりするなど、ストアを動作させるためにCookieを使用しています。お客様の同意がある場合は、パーソナライズ、分析、マーケティングにもCookieを使用します。</p>\n<p>同意の内容はいつでも変更または撤回できます。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookie設定</a></p>\n<p>詳しくは<a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">プライバシーポリシー</a>をご覧ください。</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "zh-TW": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>我們使用 Cookie 來維持本商店的運作，例如保留購物車中的商品並記住您的設定。在您同意的情況下，我們也會將 Cookie 用於個人化、分析和行銷。</p>\n<p>您可以隨時變更或撤回您的同意。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Cookie 設定</a></p>\n<p>詳情請參閱我們的<a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">隱私權政策</a>。</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "ar": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>نستخدم ملفات تعريف الارتباط لتشغيل هذا المتجر، على سبيل المثال للاحتفاظ بالمنتجات في سلة التسوق وتذكّر إعداداتك. وبموافقتك، نستخدم ملفات تعريف الارتباط أيضًا لأغراض التخصيص والتحليلات والتسويق.</p>\n<p>يمكنك تغيير موافقتك أو سحبها في أي وقت.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">إعدادات ملفات تعريف الارتباط</a></p>\n<p>اقرأ المزيد في <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">سياسة الخصوصية</a> الخاصة بنا.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "he": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>אנחנו משתמשים בעוגיות כדי להפעיל את החנות, למשל כדי לשמור פריטים בעגלת הקניות ולזכור את ההגדרות שלך. בהסכמתך, אנחנו משתמשים בעוגיות גם להתאמה אישית, לניתוח נתונים ולשיווק.</p>\n<p>אפשר לשנות או לבטל את ההסכמה בכל עת.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">הגדרות עוגיות</a></p>\n<p>מידע נוסף ב<a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">מדיניות הפרטיות</a> שלנו.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "id": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Kami menggunakan cookie agar toko ini berfungsi, misalnya untuk menyimpan item di keranjang Anda dan mengingat pengaturan Anda. Dengan persetujuan Anda, kami juga menggunakan cookie untuk personalisasi, analitik, dan pemasaran.</p>\n<p>Anda dapat mengubah atau menarik persetujuan Anda kapan saja.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Pengaturan cookie</a></p>\n<p>Baca selengkapnya di <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">Kebijakan Privasi</a> kami.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "th": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>เราใช้คุกกี้เพื่อให้ร้านค้านี้ทำงานได้ เช่น เก็บสินค้าไว้ในตะกร้าและจดจำการตั้งค่าของคุณ และเมื่อได้รับความยินยอมจากคุณ เรายังใช้คุกกี้เพื่อการปรับให้เหมาะกับคุณ การวิเคราะห์ และการตลาด</p>\n<p>คุณสามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงหรือถอนความยินยอมได้ทุกเมื่อ</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">การตั้งค่าคุกกี้</a></p>\n<p>อ่านเพิ่มเติมได้ใน<a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัว</a>ของเรา</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
 "no": "<div class=\"cv-cookies\" style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<p>Vi bruker informasjonskapsler for at denne butikken skal fungere, for eksempel for å beholde varer i handlekurven din og huske innstillingene dine. Med ditt samtykke bruker vi også informasjonskapsler til personalisering, analyse og markedsføring.</p>\n<p>Du kan når som helst endre eller trekke tilbake samtykket ditt.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-link=\"pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" data-cv-cookie-settings style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border:1px solid currentColor;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;background:none;box-shadow:none;\">Innstillinger for informasjonskapsler</a></p>\n<p>Les mer i vår <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\" data-cv-link=\"policies/privacy-policy\">personvernerklæring</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var root = (window.Shopify && Shopify.routes && Shopify.routes.root) || '/';\n  document.querySelectorAll('.cv-cookies [data-cv-link]').forEach(function (a) { a.href = root + a.getAttribute('data-cv-link'); });\n  var b = document.querySelector('.cv-cookies [data-cv-cookie-settings]');\n  if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (window.privacyBanner && typeof window.privacyBanner.showPreferences === 'function') { e.preventDefault(); window.privacyBanner.showPreferences(); }\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n"
